- *             "fields":    ["month num", "cogs", ...],      fields no column matched
- *             "unclaimed": ["Bank service charge", ...] }   columns that matched nothing
- * Response: { "mapping": { "cogs": "Cost of Goods" },
- *             "other":   { "Bank service charge": "operating" } }
